<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs this afternoon.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs this afternoon.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Thursday it would issue T$5 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposit later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 3 p.m. (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
